# Allow-list: the image needs only what builds the wheel, plus the GPU tenant manifest.
# The version comes in as the VERSION build-arg, so .git is not needed (the Dockerfile installs no git).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!gpu-tenant.yaml
!src/
src/argus_puppet/_version.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
